  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to integrate gender based violence prevention into climate programming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide intensive technical assistance to implementing partners to design and integrate up to four gender based violence prevention pilots into Middle East and North Africa regional climate programming. The pilot interventions should apply the ecological model to address the drivers of violence against women and girls, with a strong focus on maximising opportunities presented by nature-based solutions to address economic stress drivers of violence alongside social norms drivers.</narrative>
  </description>
